# The wood fracture clip of a content set: our harbour barrel, then our crate, broken by the
# native one-handed attack. Each prop: a close "intact" frame, a side take from the blow until
# the pieces sleep, then the close "pieces" frame from the same camera. `destruction2_pieces`
# gives the guards 5, 13 and 15 s after the break. The hero strikes towards +z.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
movable on
living on
noise on
destruction on
overlay off
ui off
view full

destruction2 setup barrel 1h
destruction2 view 170 90 130 0 -20 30
wait 800
shot barrel-close-before
wait 100
destruction2 view 280 100 35 0 0 35
wait 800
shot barrel-side-before
wait 100
rec barrel-side
destruction2 attack
wait 10000
stop
destruction2 checkpoint
wait 4500
destruction2 view 170 90 130 0 -20 30
wait 800
shot barrel-close-after
wait 100
destruction2 view 280 100 35 0 0 35
wait 300
shot barrel-side-after
wait 100

destruction2 setup crate 1h
destruction2 view 170 90 130 0 -20 30
wait 800
shot crate-close-before
wait 100
destruction2 view 280 100 35 0 0 35
wait 800
shot crate-side-before
wait 100
rec crate-side
destruction2 attack
wait 10000
stop
destruction2 checkpoint
wait 4500
destruction2 view 170 90 130 0 -20 30
wait 800
shot crate-close-after
wait 100
destruction2 view 280 100 35 0 0 35
wait 300
shot crate-side-after
wait 100
